- `python3 -m venv .venv && ./.venv/bin/pip install -e .` succeeds inside
  `python/09_global_executable/`, and `./.venv/bin/boukensha` boots the
  bundled REPL (same banner/behavior as `08_the_repl_loop`'s `Repl`, minus
  the two reverted improvements).
